+    `native` test module and compare with the native results (rustc 1.97.1).
+    The globals `ALL_STRS` (a `while` loop filling an array of `'static`
+    strings), `PREFIX_LENS` (nested loops) and `SPIN` (a loop which can only
+    diverge) are computed by the functions introduced for their loops. -/
+
+namespace global_init_loop.checks
